{"title":"Quant Super Practice — Mock #90","duration_min":20.0,"questions":[{"q_en":"<p>What should come in place of the question mark (?)</p><p><img width=217 height=48 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20589/image012.png\"></p>","q_hi":"<p>&#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344; (?) &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2352; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2310;&#2344;&#2366; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2367;&#2319;</p><p><img width=217 height=48 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20589/image012.png\"></p>","options_en":["0.40","0.50","0.20","0.25"],"options_hi":["0.40","0.50","0.20","0.25"],"answer":3,"solution_en":"<p><img width=217 height=48 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20589/image012.png\"></p><p><img width=239 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20589/image013.png\"></p><p><img width=239 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20589/image013.png\"></p><p><img width=96 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20589/image014.png\"></p><p>Hence, ? = 0.25</p>","solution_hi":"<p><img width=217 height=48 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20589/image012.png\"></p><p><img width=239 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20589/image013.png\"></p><p><img width=239 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20589/image013.png\"></p><p><img width=96 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20589/image014.png\"></p><p>Hence, ? = 0.25</p>","marks":1.0,"neg":0.25},{"q_en":"<p>Find the value of, <img width=145 height=20 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24048/image011.png\"> .</p>","q_hi":"<p>&#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;, <img width=145 height=20 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24048/image011.png\"> .</p>","options_en":["1.667","1.867","1.781","1.767"],"options_hi":["1.667","1.867","1.781","1.767"],"answer":2,"solution_en":"<p><img width=145 height=20 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24048/image012.png\"></p><p>=&gt; -4 + 0.543  -  (-8 + 0.976) + (-2 + 0.214)</p><p>=&gt; -4 + 0.543 + 8  -  0.976  -  2 + 0.214</p><p>=&gt; 8.757  -  6.976</p><p>=&gt; 1.781</p>","solution_hi":"<p><img width=145 height=20 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24048/image012.png\"></p><p>=&gt; -4 + 0.543  -  (-8 + 0.976) + (-2 + 0.214)</p><p>=&gt; -4 + 0.543 + 8  -  0.976  -  2 + 0.214</p><p>=&gt; 8.757  -  6.976</p><p>=&gt; 1.781</p>","marks":1.0,"neg":0.25},{"q_en":"<p>If 13 is added to both the numerator and the denominator of a fraction, then the fraction becomes 25/29. If 9 is subtracted from both the numerator and the denominator of a fraction, then the fraction becomes 7/9. Find the original fraction. </p>","q_hi":"<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2368; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344; &#2325;&#2375; &#2309;&#2306;&#2358; &#2324;&#2352; &#2361;&#2352; &#2342;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; 13 &#2332;&#2379;&#2337;&#2364; &#2342;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2319;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344; 25/29 &#2361;&#2379; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2368; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344; &#2325;&#2375; &#2309;&#2306;&#2358; &#2324;&#2352; &#2361;&#2352; &#2342;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; 9 &#2328;&#2335;&#2366; &#2342;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2319;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344; 7/9 &#2361;&#2379; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404;</p>","options_en":["39/45","37/46","37/45","39/46"],"options_hi":["39/45","37/46","37/45","39/46"],"answer":2,"solution_en":"<p>Let the required original fraction be 'a/b'.</p><p>(a + 13)/ (b + 13) = 25/29 </p><p>29a + 377 = 25b + 325 </p><p>a = (25b -52)/29 </p><p>(a  -  9)/ (b  -  9) = 7/9 </p><p>9a  -  81 = 7b  -  63 </p><p>9 (25b  -  52)/ 29  -  81 = 7b  -  63 </p><p>225b  -  468  -  2349 = 203b  -  1827 </p><p>22b = 990 </p><p>b = 45 </p><p>a = (1125  -  52)/29 = 37 </p><p>Hence, the required fraction = 37/45.</p>","solution_hi":"<p>Let the required original fraction be 'a/b'.</p><p>(a + 13)/ (b + 13) = 25/29 </p><p>29a + 377 = 25b + 325 </p><p>a = (25b -52)/29 </p><p>(a  -  9)/ (b  -  9) = 7/9 </p><p>9a  -  81 = 7b  -  63 </p><p>9 (25b  -  52)/ 29  -  81 = 7b  -  63 </p><p>225b  -  468  -  2349 = 203b  -  1827 </p><p>22b = 990 </p><p>b = 45 </p><p>a = (1125  -  52)/29 = 37 </p><p>Hence, the required fraction = 37/45.</p>","marks":1.0,"neg":0.25},{"q_en":"<p>Find the value of [(3.15)<sup>2</sup>  -  (2.24)<sup>2</sup>]/(3.15 + 2.24).</p>","q_hi":"<p>[(3.15)<sup>2</sup> - (2.24)<sup>2</sup>]/(3.15 + 2.24) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>","options_en":["0.91","0.85","5.39","1.24"],"options_hi":["0.91","0.85","5.39","1.24"],"answer":0,"solution_en":"<p>(a)<sup>2</sup>  -  (b)<sup>2</sup> = (a + b)(a  -  b)</p><p>[(3.15)<sup>2</sup>  -  (2.24)<sup>2</sup>]/(3.15 + 2.24) = [(3.15 + 2.24)(3.15  -  2.24)]/(3.15 + 2.24)</p><p>=&gt; 3.15  -  2.24 = 0.91</p>","solution_hi":"<p>(a)<sup>2</sup>  -  (b)<sup>2</sup> = (a + b)(a  -  b)</p><p>[(3.15)<sup>2</sup>  -  (2.24)<sup>2</sup>]/(3.15 + 2.24) = [(3.15 + 2.24)(3.15  -  2.24)]/(3.15 + 2.24)</p><p>=&gt; 3.15  -  2.24 = 0.91</p>","marks":1.0,"neg":0.25},{"q_en":"<p>The difference between the greatest decimal number and smallest decimal number, 0.8678, 0.09875, 0.05989, 0.7856 is: </p>","q_hi":"<p>&#2360;&#2348;&#2360;&#2375; &#2348;&#2337;&#2364;&#2368; &#2342;&#2358;&#2350;&#2354;&#2357; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2324;&#2352; &#2360;&#2348;&#2360;&#2375; &#2331;&#2379;&#2335;&#2368; &#2342;&#2358;&#2350;&#2354;&#2357; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;, 0.8678, 0.09875, 0.05989, 0.7856 &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2368;&#2330; &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2306;&#2340;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376;: </p>","options_en":["0.81791","0.83791","0.80791","0.82791"],"options_hi":["0.81791","0.83791","0.80791","0.82791"],"answer":2,"solution_en":"<p>The greatest decimal number = 0.8678</p><p>The smallest decimal number = 0.05989</p><p>So, the required difference = 0.8678  -  0.05989 = 0.80791 </p>","solution_hi":"<p>The greatest decimal number = 0.8678</p><p>The smallest decimal number = 0.05989</p><p>So, the required difference = 0.8678  -  0.05989 = 0.80791 </p>","marks":1.0,"neg":0.25},{"q_en":"<p>Which of the following fractions are in descending order? </p>","q_hi":"<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2368; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344; &#2309;&#2357;&#2352;&#2379;&#2361;&#2368; &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;?</p>","options_en":["23/27, 21/24, 24/29, 27/33","24/29, 23, 27, 27/33, 21/24","21/24, 23/27, 24/29, 27/33","27/33, 24/29, 23/27, 21/24"],"options_hi":["23/27, 21/24, 24/29, 27/33","24/29, 23, 27, 27/33, 21/24","21/24, 23/27, 24/29, 27/33","27/33, 24/29, 23/27, 21/24"],"answer":2,"solution_en":"<p>23/27, 21/24, 24/29, 27/33</p><p>L.C.M of 27, 24, 29, 33 = 68904</p><p>(23 * 2552, 21 * 2871, 24 * 2376, 27 * 2088)/ 68904</p><p>58696/68904, 60291/68904, 57024/68904, 56376/68904</p><p>Descending order: 60291/68904, 58696/68904, 57024/68904, 56376/68904</p><p>Hence, 21/24, 23/27, 24/29, 27/33</p>","solution_hi":"<p>23/27, 21/24, 24/29, 27/33</p><p>L.C.M of 27, 24, 29, 33 = 68904</p><p>(23 * 2552, 21 * 2871, 24 * 2376, 27 * 2088)/ 68904</p><p>58696/68904, 60291/68904, 57024/68904, 56376/68904</p><p>Descending order: 60291/68904, 58696/68904, 57024/68904, 56376/68904</p><p>Hence, 21/24, 23/27, 24/29, 27/33</p>","marks":1.0,"neg":0.25},{"q_en":"<p>Find the value of <img width=75 height=23 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24286/image007.png\">.</p>","q_hi":"<p><img width=75 height=23 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24286/image007.png\"> &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;.</p>","options_en":["38/33","33/38","16/99","57/50"],"options_hi":["38/33","33/38","16/99","57/50"],"answer":0,"solution_en":"<p><img width=73 height=23 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24286/image008.png\"> </p><p>Let x = 0.4949...</p><p>100x = 49.4949..</p><p>100x  -  x = 49.4949.. - 0.4949..</p><p>99x = 49</p><p>x = 49/99</p><p>Similarly, </p><p>0.65.. = 65/99</p><p>=&gt; 49/99 + 65/99</p><p>=&gt; 114/99</p><p>=&gt; 38/33</p>","solution_hi":"<p><img width=73 height=23 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24286/image008.png\"> </p><p>Let x = 0.4949...</p><p>100x = 49.4949..</p><p>100x  -  x = 49.4949.. - 0.4949..</p><p>99x = 49</p><p>x = 49/99</p><p>Similarly, </p><p>0.65.. = 65/99</p><p>=&gt; 49/99 + 65/99</p><p>=&gt; 114/99</p><p>=&gt; 38/33</p>","marks":1.0,"neg":0.25},{"q_en":"<p>Which of the following numbers has a terminating decimal? </p><p>349/85, 347/80, 651/45, 333/82 </p>","q_hi":"<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366; &#2342;&#2358;&#2350;&#2354;&#2357; &#2309;&#2306;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;?</p><p>349/85, 347/80, 651/45, 333/82 </p>","options_en":["651/45","347/80","333/82","349/85"],"options_hi":["651/45","347/80","333/82","349/85"],"answer":1,"solution_en":"<p><b>[If the denominator contains only factors of 2 and /or 5, then its decimal expansion will terminate]</b></p><p>(a) 651/45</p><p>Factor of 45 = 5 * 9 [non-terminating decimal] </p><p>(b) 347/80</p><p>Factor of 80 = 2 * 2 * 2 * 2 * 5 <b>[Terminating decimal]</b></p><p>(c) 333/82</p><p>Factor of 82 = 2 * 41 [non-terminating decimal] </p><p>(d) 349/85</p><p>Factor of 85 = 5 * 17 [non-terminating decimal] </p>","solution_hi":"<p><b>[If the denominator contains only factors of 2 and /or 5, then its decimal expansion will terminate]</b></p><p>(a) 651/45</p><p>Factor of 45 = 5 * 9 [non-terminating decimal] </p><p>(b) 347/80</p><p>Factor of 80 = 2 * 2 * 2 * 2 * 5 <b>[Terminating decimal]</b></p><p>(c) 333/82</p><p>Factor of 82 = 2 * 41 [non-terminating decimal] </p><p>(d) 349/85</p><p>Factor of 85 = 5 * 17 [non-terminating decimal] </p>","marks":1.0,"neg":0.25},{"q_en":"<p>If the value of 1/32.12 is 0.03113, then what is the value of 1/0.00003212? </p>","q_hi":"<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 1/32.12 &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; 0.03113 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; 1/0.00003212 &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>","options_en":["3113","31130","311.3","31.13"],"options_hi":["3113","31130","311.3","31.13"],"answer":1,"solution_en":"<p>1/32.12 = 0.03113</p><p>100/3212 = 0.03113 </p><p>1/0.00003212 = 100000000/3212 = 31130 </p>","solution_hi":"<p>1/32.12 = 0.03113</p><p>100/3212 = 0.03113 </p><p>1/0.00003212 = 100000000/3212 = 31130 </p>","marks":1.0,"neg":0.25},{"q_en":"<p>What is the sum of the largest and smallest fraction, among 13/42, 17/28, 11/24, and 23/36? </p>","q_hi":"<p>13/42, 17/28, 11/24 &#2324;&#2352; 23/36 &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2348;&#2360;&#2375; &#2348;&#2337;&#2364;&#2368; &#2324;&#2352; &#2360;&#2348;&#2360;&#2375; &#2331;&#2379;&#2335;&#2368; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344; &#2325;&#2366; &#2351;&#2379;&#2327; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>","options_en":["241/252","242/253","239/252","239/253"],"options_hi":["241/252","242/253","239/252","239/253"],"answer":2,"solution_en":"<p>L.C.M of 42, 28, 24, and 36 = 504</p><p>13/42 = 156/504</p><p>17/28 = 306/504</p><p>11/24 = 231/504</p><p>23/36 = 322/504</p><p>Hence, the required sum = 13/42 + 23/36 = 78/252 + 161/252 = 239/252</p>","solution_hi":"<p>L.C.M of 42, 28, 24, and 36 = 504</p><p>13/42 = 156/504</p><p>17/28 = 306/504</p><p>11/24 = 231/504</p><p>23/36 = 322/504</p><p>Hence, the required sum = 13/42 + 23/36 = 78/252 + 161/252 = 239/252</p>","marks":1.0,"neg":0.25},{"q_en":"<p>Which of the following fraction is in ascending order?</p>","q_hi":"<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2368; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344; &#2310;&#2352;&#2379;&#2361;&#2368; &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>","options_en":["3/4 &lt; 15/16 &lt; 28/23 &lt; 24/12","15/16 &lt; 3/4 &lt; 28/23 &lt; 24/12","28/23 &lt; 24/12 &lt; 15/16 &lt; 3/4","24/12 &lt; 15/16 &lt; 3/4 &lt; 28/23"],"options_hi":["3/4 &lt; 15/16 &lt; 28/23 &lt; 24/12","15/16 &lt; 3/4 &lt; 28/23 &lt; 24/12","28/23 &lt; 24/12 &lt; 15/16 &lt; 3/4","24/12 &lt; 15/16 &lt; 3/4 &lt; 28/23"],"answer":0,"solution_en":"<p>3/4 = 0.75</p><p>15/16 = 0.9375</p><p>28/23 = 1.21739...</p><p>24/12 = 2</p>","solution_hi":"<p>3/4 = 0.75</p><p>15/16 = 0.9375</p><p>28/23 = 1.21739...</p><p>24/12 = 2</p>","marks":1.0,"neg":0.25},{"q_en":"<p>What is the fractional form of 17.24444?</p>","q_hi":"<p>17.24444 &#2325;&#2366; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2349;&#2366;&#2332;&#2368; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>","options_en":["17(11/43)","17(11/45)","17(8/45)","17(8/43)"],"options_hi":["17(11/43)","17(11/45)","17(8/45)","17(8/43)"],"answer":1,"solution_en":"<p>Let X = 17.24444 = 17.2444 ...(i)</p><p>Then, 100X = 1724.4444 ...(ii)</p><p>On subtracting (i) from (ii), we get -</p><p>99X = 1707.2</p><p>Then, <b>X = 17(11/45)</b></p>","solution_hi":"<p>Let X = 17.24444 = 17.2444 ...(i)</p><p>Then, 100X = 1724.4444 ...(ii)</p><p>On subtracting (i) from (ii), we get -</p><p>99X = 1707.2</p><p>Then, <b>X = 17(11/45)</b></p>","marks":1.0,"neg":0.25},{"q_en":"<p>What is the value of</p><p>(0.8 * 0.4<sup>2</sup> - 0.16<sup>2</sup> + 9 * 0.02<sup>2</sup>)/(0.2 * 0.8 - 0.3 * 0.2)?</p>","q_hi":"<p>(0.8* 0.4<sup>2</sup>- 0.16<sup>2</sup>+9*0.02<sup>2</sup>)/(0.2*0.8-0.3*0.2) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>","options_en":["1.06","2.16","0.08","1.16"],"options_hi":["1.06","2.16","0.08","1.16"],"answer":0,"solution_en":"<p>= (0.8 * 0.4<sup>2</sup> - 0.16<sup>2</sup> + 9 * 0.02<sup>2</sup>)/(0.2 * 0.8 - 0.3 * 0.2)</p><p>= [0.02<sup>2</sup> * (0.8 * 20<sup>2</sup> - 8<sup>2</sup> + 9)]/[0.2 * (0.8 - 0.3)]</p><p>= [0.02 * 0.1 * (320 - 64 + 9)]/0.5</p><p>= (0.02 * 0.1 * 265)/0.5</p><p>= 0.53/0.5</p><p>= 1.06</p>","solution_hi":"<p>= (0.8 * 0.4<sup>2</sup> - 0.16<sup>2</sup> + 9 * 0.02<sup>2</sup>)/(0.2 * 0.8 - 0.3 * 0.2)</p><p>= [0.02<sup>2</sup> * (0.8 * 20<sup>2</sup> - 8<sup>2</sup> + 9)]/[0.2 * (0.8 - 0.3)]</p><p>= [0.02 * 0.1 * (320 - 64 + 9)]/0.5</p><p>= (0.02 * 0.1 * 265)/0.5</p><p>= 0.53/0.5</p><p>= 1.06</p>","marks":1.0,"neg":0.25},{"q_en":"<p>Which of the fractions does not lie between 9/17 and 4/5?</p>","q_hi":"<p>9/17 &#2324;&#2352; 4/5 &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2368;&#2330; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344;-&#2360;&#2366; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344; &#2344;&#2361;&#2368;&#2306; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>","options_en":["2/3","3/4","5/6","4/7"],"options_hi":["2/3","3/4","5/6","4/7"],"answer":2,"solution_en":"<p>LCM of 7, 17, 3, 4, 6, 5 = 7140</p><p>9/17 = 3780/7140</p><p>4/5 = 5712/7140</p><p>4/7 = 4080/7140</p><p>2/3 = 4760/7140</p><p>3/4 = 5355/7140</p><p>5/6 = 5950/7140</p><p>So, 5/6 does not lie between 9/17 and 4/5.</p>","solution_hi":"<p>LCM of 7, 17, 3, 4, 6, 5 = 7140</p><p>9/17 = 3780/7140</p><p>4/5 = 5712/7140</p><p>4/7 = 4080/7140</p><p>2/3 = 4760/7140</p><p>3/4 = 5355/7140</p><p>5/6 = 5950/7140</p><p>So, 5/6 does not lie between 9/17 and 4/5.</p>","marks":1.0,"neg":0.25},{"q_en":"<p>The numerator of a fraction is one more than 6 times its denominator. If 32% of this fraction is taken, then, in the resultant fraction, the denominator becomes equal to 125 and the numerator doubles. 2/11<sup>th</sup> part of the given fraction is  - </p>","q_hi":"<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344; &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2306;&#2358; &#2311;&#2360;&#2325;&#2375; &#2361;&#2352; &#2325;&#2375; 6 &#2327;&#2369;&#2344;&#2366; &#2360;&#2375; &#2319;&#2325; &#2309;&#2343;&#2367;&#2325; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2311;&#2360; &#2309;&#2306;&#2358; &#2325;&#2366; 32% &#2361;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2360;&#2366; &#2354;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379;, &#2346;&#2352;&#2367;&#2339;&#2366;&#2350;&#2368; &#2309;&#2306;&#2358; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2361;&#2352; 125 &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2361;&#2379; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; &#2309;&#2306;&#2358; &#2342;&#2379;&#2327;&#2369;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2379; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344; &#2325;&#2366; 2/11 &#2357;&#2366;&#2306; &#2349;&#2366;&#2327; &#2361;&#2376; -</p>","options_en":["5.5","1.1","11","11/2"],"options_hi":["5.5","1.1","11","11/2"],"answer":1,"solution_en":"<p>Let the fraction be N/D</p><p>N = 6D+1</p><p>Thus, fraction = (6D+1) / D</p><p>Now,</p><p>0.32 *(6D+1)/D = 2 *(6D+1)/125</p><p>D = 0.32 *125/2 = 20</p><p>Thus, numerator = 6*20 + 1 = 121</p><p>Fraction = 121/20</p><p>2/11<sup>th</sup> part of 121/20 = 11/10= 1.1</p>","solution_hi":"<p>Let the fraction be N/D</p><p>N = 6D+1</p><p>Thus, fraction = (6D+1) / D</p><p>Now,</p><p>0.32 *(6D+1)/D = 2 *(6D+1)/125</p><p>D = 0.32 *125/2 = 20</p><p>Thus, numerator = 6*20 + 1 = 121</p><p>Fraction = 121/20</p><p>2/11<sup>th</sup> part of 121/20 = 11/10= 1.1</p>","marks":1.0,"neg":0.25},{"q_en":"<p>What is the simplified value of 129.<span style=\"text-decoration: overline\">39","q_hi":"<p>129.39 - 33.45 + 93.33 - 56.26 &#2325;&#2366; &#2360;&#2352;&#2354;&#2368;&#2325;&#2371;&#2340; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>","options_en":["121.11","133.01","142.12","123.14"],"options_hi":["121.11","133.01","142.12","123.14"],"answer":1,"solution_en":"<p><img width=215 height=24 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p9899/image007.png\"></p><p>= 129.39393939  -  33.45454545 + 93.33333333  -  56.26262626</p><p>= 133.010101</p><p>= 133.01</p>","solution_hi":"<p><img width=215 height=24 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p9899/image007.png\"></p><p>= 129.39393939  -  33.45454545 + 93.33333333  -  56.26262626</p><p>= 133.010101</p><p>= 133.01</p>","marks":1.0,"neg":0.25},{"q_en":"<p>Find the sum of the first two largest fractions.</p><p><div><div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">13","q_hi":"<p>&#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2341;&#2350; &#2342;&#2379; &#2360;&#2348;&#2360;&#2375; &#2348;&#2337;&#2364;&#2368; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2351;&#2379;&#2327;&#2347;&#2354; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p><p><div><div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">13","options_en":["245/168","235/168","255/168","225/168"],"options_hi":["245/168","235/168","255/168","225/168"],"answer":0,"solution_en":"<p>L.C.M of 25, 24, 35, and 28 = 4200</p><p>13/25 = 2184/4200</p><p>17/24 = 2975/4200</p><p>19/35 = 1080/4200</p><p>21/28 = 3150/4200</p><p>Hence, the required sum = 2975/4200 + 3150/4200 = 6125/4200 = 245/168</p>","solution_hi":"<p>L.C.M of 25, 24, 35, and 28 = 4200</p><p>13/25 = 2184/4200</p><p>17/24 = 2975/4200</p><p>19/35 = 1080/4200</p><p>21/28 = 3150/4200</p><p>Hence, the required sum = 2975/4200 + 3150/4200 = 6125/4200 = 245/168</p>","marks":1.0,"neg":0.25},{"q_en":"<p><div>&nbsp;Number A is&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">5","q_hi":"<p>&#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; A, &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; B &#2325;&#2366; 5/7 &#2349;&#2366;&#2327; &#2361;&#2376; &#2332;&#2348;&#2325;&#2367; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; B, &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; C &#2325;&#2366; 2/3 &#2349;&#2366;&#2327; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; A &#2324;&#2352; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; C &#2325;&#2375; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2346;&#2366;&#2340; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2351;&#2375;&#2404;</p>","options_en":["10 : 17","5 : 16","10 : 21","15 : 23"],"options_hi":["10: 17","5: 16","10: 21","15: 23"],"answer":2,"solution_en":"<p>According to the question:</p><p>A = 5B/7 ...... (1)</p><p>B = 2C/3 ....... (2)</p><p>From (1) and (2):</p><p>A = (5/7) * (2C/3)</p><p>A = 10C/21</p><p>A/C = 10/21</p><p>A: C = 10: 21</p>","solution_hi":"<p>According to the question:</p><p>A = 5B/7 ...... (1)</p><p>B = 2C/3 ....... (2)</p><p>From (1) and (2):</p><p>A = (5/7) * (2C/3)</p><p>A = 10C/21</p><p>A/C = 10/21</p><p>A: C = 10: 21</p>","marks":1.0,"neg":0.25},{"q_en":"<p>1/11<sup>th</sup> part of a pole is painted black, 1/2<sup>nd</sup> part of the rest is painted red and remaining 8.5m is painted white. What is the length of the pole?</p>","q_hi":"<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2326;&#2306;&#2349;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366; 1/11 &#2349;&#2366;&#2327; &#2325;&#2366;&#2354;&#2375; &#2352;&#2306;&#2327; &#2360;&#2375;, &#2358;&#2375;&#2359; &#2325;&#2366; 1/2 &#2349;&#2366;&#2327; &#2354;&#2366;&#2354; &#2352;&#2306;&#2327; &#2360;&#2375; &#2324;&#2352; &#2358;&#2375;&#2359; 8.5 m &#2360;&#2347;&#2375;&#2342; &#2352;&#2306;&#2327; &#2360;&#2375; &#2352;&#2306;&#2327;&#2366; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2326;&#2306;&#2349;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; &#2354;&#2350;&#2381;&#2348;&#2366;&#2312; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>","options_en":["18.7 m","22.3 m","16.2 m","19.1 m"],"options_hi":["18.7 m","22.3 m","16.2 m","19.1 m"],"answer":0,"solution_en":"<p>If the length of the pole is X cm, then,</p><p>(17/2) = X * (1  -  (1/11)) * (1  -  (1/2))</p><p>17/2 = X * (10/11) * (1/2)</p><p>X = 187/10 = 18.7 m</p>","solution_hi":"<p>If the length of the pole is X cm, then,</p><p>(17/2) = X * (1  -  (1/11)) * (1  -  (1/2))</p><p>17/2 = X * (10/11) * (1/2)</p><p>X = 187/10 = 18.7 m</p>","marks":1.0,"neg":0.25}]}